    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PirateGate</i></strong><i>\u00a0is an <strong>Action Third Person Shooter</strong> with combat inspired by Horizon Zero Dawn, exploration by Stargate and Assassin's Creed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong><i>Evalyn</i></strong>, a spirited young pirate girl, niece of the captain of \u201c<i>The Fall of South\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She seeks adventure and hopes to discover a great treasure. Help her in her journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new worlds:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.poster.avif?t=1755378417\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.webm?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.mp4?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Find allies, new weapons and fight to survive with real time action combat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.poster.avif?t=1755378417\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.webm?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.mp4?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve minigames.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/51db93540deebe983dc0b8d83a1f6e04.poster.avif?t=1755378417\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/51db93540deebe983dc0b8d83a1f6e04.webm?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/51db93540deebe983dc0b8d83a1f6e04.mp4?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more to discover.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PirateGate</i></strong><i>\u00a0is an <strong>Action Third Person Shooter</strong> with combat inspired by Horizon Zero Dawn, exploration by Stargate and Assassin's Creed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong><i>Evalyn</i></strong>, a spirited young pirate girl, niece of the captain of \u201c<i>The Fall of South\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She seeks adventure and hopes to discover a great treasure. Help her in her journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore new worlds:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.poster.avif?t=1755378417\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.webm?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/fb09e9b8d469b89e956999707eb19d0e.mp4?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Find allies, new weapons and fight to survive with real time action combat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.poster.avif?t=1755378417\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.webm?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695960/extras/c786e1ced3ff678b5534756191767bc4.mp4?t=1755378417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp